## Related success criteria

No Keyboard Trap is closely related to the following success criteria:

* [2.1.1 Keyboard (A)](2.1.1.html) applies when users cannot use a component with a keyboard. 
* [2.4.7 Focus Visible (AA)](2.4.7.html) applies when users can exit a component, but they cannot see where they are on the page. 
* [2.4.11 Focus Not Obscured (AA)](2.4.11.html) applies when users can exit a component but something is covering the keyboard focus and they cannot see it. 
